{
    # One Neuro SAN network: the player coordinator is the public entry point,
    # and directly routes lifecycle messages to the embedded canonical planner
    # and watcher agents. There is deliberately no extra routing agent.
    # Load shared substitutions at this outer level so nested canonical graph
    # includes cannot change their resolution base.
